OL,3,GNEWSATroubles investigations could cost
OL,4,Aup to #630m, says legacy body chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt could cost about #630m and take
OL,7,Fseven years to deal with investigations
OL,8,Frelated to the Northern Ireland
OL,9,FTroubles, the head of the legacy body
OL,10,Fhas estimated.
OL,12,FSir Declan Morgan has told MPs it could
OL,13,Fend up handling 650 investigations once
OL,14,Fit is reformed in legislation before
OL,15,FParliament.
OL,17,FThe Independent Commission for
OL,18,FReconciliation and Information Recovery
OL,19,F(ICRIR) is due to become a new Legacy
OL,20,FCommission next year.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
