OL,3,GNEWSATroubles investigations could cost
OL,4,Aup to #630m, says legacy body chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is currently awaiting a UK Treasury
OL,7,Fdecision on a bid for more funding made
OL,8,Fearlier this year.
